e selected when referencing the triad's marriage contract, the recruitment of the assassin Estra Hamilton, or the 11-day hostage crisis involving her brother Alec. Key relationships include the legally-binding triadic union between Ryan, Charlotte, and Florence (witnessed by Rachael Blakeney), and the provisional alliance with Estra, who is a double agent against Loren. The accord establishes critical plot deadlines and mutual autonomy protections for the triad."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 007] - The Assassin's Accord.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1mfb7m3","at":1777331817923},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 007] - The Assassin's Accord.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":836,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
