Continuity#{5}":[51,51],"#The Assassin's Accord#Outcome & Continuity#{6}":[52,52]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["triadic marriage","legal autonomy","sleep interrogation","unarmed combat","sexual instruction","karambit","contract signing","friendship defense","hospitalization risk"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"The Assassin's Accord is a pivotal legal and personal agreement. It should be selected when referencing the triad's marriage contract, the recruitment of the assassin Estra Hamilton, or the 11-day hostage crisis involving her brother Alec. Key relationships include the legally-binding triadic union between Ryan, Charlotte, and Florence (witnessed by Rachael Blakeney), and the provisional alliance with Estra, who is a double agent against Loren. The accord establishes critical plot deadlines and mutual autonomy protections for the triad."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 007] - The Assassin's Accord.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"1mfb7m3","at":1777331883699},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.07075723,0.00167074,-0.04045451,0.0301684,-0.03613253,-0.02945236,0.0550092,0.02452676,0.03434459,0.00006283,0.05702076,-0.04573874,0.04879907,-0.01925183,0.02918119,0.00386738,-0.02899218,0.04372645,-0.06962965,0.02751815,0.01800532,-0.03843329,-0.02468443,0.01776626,0.01356491,0.00308655,-0.01933758,-0.04757431,-0.09381171,-0.19881347,-0.01628659,0.05597703,0.01033116,0.07346996,0.01369715,-0.01748083,-0.0798514,0.04125555,-0.00988825,-0.03954035,0.032027,0.04905282,-0.01504769,0.00102894,0.00105152,-0.05339744,0.006835,0.01353591,-0.00571603,-0.03565727,-0.0527509,-0.01403768,-0.01945545,0.01878755,0.01850825,0.05820631,0.09303506,0.04824382,0.0226518,0.04588147,0.0635465,0.04999441,-0.15452932,0.08029082,0.00589619,0.02020652,-0.03893036,-0.06044164,0.01916097,0.0194656,-0.0798475,0.02